---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout>
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
        <a
            href="/"
            class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground no-underline transition-colors"
        >
            &larr; Back to Audexis
        </a>

        <header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-8">
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-headings">
                Privacy Policy
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Effective Date: October 19, 2026
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    1. Core Philosophy: Zero Telemetry
                </h2>
                <p>
                    Audexis is designed with a strict privacy-first principle.
                    We believe software should simply perform its function
                    without surveilling its users.
                    <strong>
                        The Audexis desktop application does not collect, track,
                        log, or transmit any listening habits, analytics,
                        behavioral telemetry, device identifiers, or usage logs.
                    </strong>
                    Your local library and playback activity remain entirely on
                    your physical hardware.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    2. Information We Process for Audexis Cloud
                </h2>
                <p class="mb-3">
                    If you voluntarily subscribe to the optional{" "}
                    <strong>Audexis Cloud</strong> service, we process only the
                    strictly necessary technical data required to maintain your
                    account, handle payments, and serve your files:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Account Credentials:</strong> Your email address
                        and basic profile identifier provided via OAuth
                        authentication (GitHub or Google) or standard
                        registration to authenticate your identity.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Payment & Billing Information:</strong> Payment
                        transactions are handled directly by our PCI-compliant
                        payment processor, Stripe. Audexis never sees, stores,
                        or processes your raw credit card numbers or banking
                        credentials. We receive only confirmation of payment
                        status, subscription renewal dates, and randomized
                        customer tokens from Stripe.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Personal Audio & Metadata:</strong> WWhen you
                        upload audio tracks to your Audexis Cloud storage, we
                        host your audio files and their parsed metadata (track
                        names, artist names, album titles, durations) strictly
                        to provide remote playback to your authorized devices.
                        Files are protected using industry-standard encryption
                        at rest (AES-256 storage-level encryption) and TLS
                        encryption in transit.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    3. How Your Files Are Handled
                </h2>
                <p>Your audio library is treated as strictly private data:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 mt-2">
                    <li>
                        We do not analyze, data-mine, fingerprint, or run
                        machine learning algorithms on your uploaded audio
                        content.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Your files are never shared with, licensed to, or
                        accessible by third parties.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Your audio streams are accessible only to devices
                        authenticated with your personal API keys or account
                        session tokens.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    4. Third-Party Service Providers
                </h2>
                <p class="mb-3">
                    To provide the cloud infrastructure and authentication
                    services, we partner with trusted infrastructure providers
                    who adhere to strict data security standards:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Authentication:</strong> GitHub and Google
                        (strictly for identity verification during OAuth login).
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Billing:</strong> Stripe, Inc. (for secure
                        billing and subscription lifecycle management).
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Cloud Infrastructure:</strong> Cloud
                        Infrastructure: Managed cloud servers and secure object
                        storage providers for housing audio storage and
                        operational databases with encryption at rest and
                        isolated tenant access controls. databases.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    5. Data Retention & Deletion
                </h2>
                <p>
                    You retain absolute ownership of your account and personal
                    data. You may delete your account, revoke device API keys,
                    or cancel your subscription at any time via your dashboard.
                    Upon account deletion, all personal records, active keys,
                    and associated cloud audio files are permanently purged from
                    our primary database and storage infrastructure.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-3">
                    6. Contact Information
                </h2>
                <p>
                    If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or our
                    zero-telemetry architecture, you can contact the project
                    maintainer directly at{" "}
                    <a
                        href="mailto:support@audexis.app"
                        class="text-primary hover:underline"
                    >
                        support@audexis.app
                    </a>{" "}
                    or open an issue on our official GitHub repository.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
